(594, 384, 'short_details', 'Addiction is more than just a bad habit—it’s a complex condition that affects the brain and behavior. Whether it\'s drugs, alcohol, gambling, or even technology, addiction creates a powerful craving that can take over a person\'s life. It often starts subtly but grows silently, causing emotional, physical, and social harm.'),
