(30, 1, '2025-04-08 13:00:08', '2025-04-08 13:00:08', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.(<strong>\"Company\"</strong>&nbsp;or<strong>&nbsp;\"We\"</strong>) respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy describes the types of information we may collect from you or that you may provide when you visit the website personalempowermentteams.me (our \"<strong>Website</strong>\") and our practices for collecting, using, maintaining, protecting, and disclosing that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy applies to information we collect:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On this Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In email, and other electronic messages between you and this <strong>Website or Company.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It does not apply to information collected by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Us offline or through any other means, including on any other website operated by Company or any third party.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please read this policy carefully to understand our policies and practices regarding your information and how we will treat it. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, your choice is not to use our Website. By accessing or using this Website, you agree to this privacy policy. This policy may change from time to time. Your continued use of this Website after we make changes is deemed to be acceptance of those changes, so please check the policy periodically for updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Children Under the Age of 18</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our Website is not intended for children under 18 years of age. No one under age 18 may provide any information to Company or on the Website. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If you are under 18, do not use or provide any information on this Website or provide any information about yourself to us, including your name, address, telephone number, email address, or any screen name or user name you may use. If we learn we have collected or received personal information from a child under 18 without verification of parental consent, we will delete that information. If you believe we might have any information from or about a child under 18, please contact us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Information We Collect About You and How We Collect It</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We collect several types of information from and about users of our Website, including information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>By which you may be personally identified, such as name, username, postal address, email address, telephone number (\"<strong>personal information</strong>”); and/or</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>About your internet connection, the equipment you use to access our Website, and usage details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We collect this information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Directly from you when you provide it to us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automatically as you navigate through the site. Information collected automatically may include usage details, IP addresses, and information collected through cookies, web beacons, and other tracking technologies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Information You Provide to Us</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect on or through our Website may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information that you provide by filling in forms on our Website. This includes information provided at the time of submitting a contact form, subscribing to our service, posting material, or requesting further services. We may also ask you for information to assist you in the use and navigation of the website and/or when you report a problem with our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Records and copies of your correspondence (including email addresses), if you contact us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your responses to surveys that we might ask you to complete for research purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You also may provide information to be published or displayed (hereinafter, \"<strong>posted</strong>\") on public areas of the Website, or transmitted to other users of the Website or third parties (collectively, \"<strong>User Contributions</strong>\"). Your User Contributions are posted on and transmitted to others at your own risk. Please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable. Additionally, we cannot control the actions of other users of the Website with whom you may choose to share your User Contributions. Therefore, we cannot and do not guarantee that your User Contributions will not be viewed by unauthorized persons.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Information We Collect Through Automatic Data Collection Technologies</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you navigate through and interact with our Website, we may use automatic data collection technologies to collect certain information about your equipment, browsing actions, and patterns, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Details of your visits to our Website, including traffic data, location data, logs, and other communication data and the resources that you access and use on the Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information about your computer and internet connection, including your IP address, operating system, and browser type.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect automatically does not include personal information, but we may maintain it or associate it with personal information we collect in other ways or receive from third parties. It helps us to improve our Website and to deliver a better and more personalized service, including by enabling us to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Estimate our audience size and usage patterns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Store information about your preferences, allowing us to customize our Website according to your individual interests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Speed up your searches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recognize you when you return to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The technologies we use for this automatic data collection may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cookies (or browser cookies).</strong> A cookie is a small file placed on the hard drive of your computer. You may refuse to accept browser cookies by activating the appropriate setting on your browser. However, if you select this setting you may be unable to access certain parts of our Website. Unless you have adjusted your browser setting so that it will refuse cookies, our system will issue cookies when you direct your browser to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Web Beacons. </strong>Pages of our Website and our emails may contain small electronic files known as web beacons (also referred to as clear gifs, pixel tags, and single-pixel gifs) that permit the Company, for example, to count users who have visited those pages or opened an email and for other related website statistics (for example, recording the popularity of certain website content and verifying system and server integrity).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not collect personal information automatically, but we may tie non-personal information collected automatically to personal information about you that we collect from other sources or that you provide to us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Third-Party Use of Cookies [and Other Tracking Technologies</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some content or applications, including advertisements, on the Website are served by third-parties, including advertisers, ad networks and servers, content providers, and application providers. These third parties may use cookies alone or in conjunction with web beacons or other tracking technologies to collect information about you when you use our website. The information they collect may be associated with your personal information or they may collect information, including personal information, about your online activities over time and across different websites and other online services. They may use this information to provide you with interest-based (behavioral) advertising or other targeted content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control these third parties\' tracking technologies or how they may be used. If you have any questions about an advertisement or other targeted content, you should contact the responsible provider directly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How We Use Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use information that we collect about you or that you provide to us, including any personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To present our Website and its contents to you.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To provide you with information, products, or services that you request from us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill any other purpose for which you provide it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To carry out our obligations and enforce our rights arising from any contracts entered into between you and us, including for billing and collection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To notify you about changes to our Website or any products or services we offer or provide though it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In any other way we may describe when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose with your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also use your information to contact you about our own goods and services that may be of interest to you. If you do not want us to use your information in this way, please check the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Disclosure of Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose aggregated information about our users and information that does not identify any individual without restriction.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose personal information that we collect or you provide as described in this privacy policy:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To contractors, service providers, and other third parties we use to support our business.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To a buyer or other successor in the event of a merger, divestiture, restructuring, reorganization, dissolution, or other sale or transfer of some or all of Company\'s assets, whether as a going concern or as part of bankruptcy, liquidation, or similar proceeding, in which personal information held by Company about our Website users is among the assets transferred.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill the purpose for which you provide it. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose disclosed by us when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also disclose your personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To comply with any court order, law, or legal process, including to respond to any government or regulatory request.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To enforce or apply our <a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">terms of use</a> (<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>) and other agreements, including for billing and collection purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If we believe disclosure is necessary or appropriate to protect the rights, property, or safety of the Company, our customers, or others.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Choices About How We Use and Disclose Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We strive to provide you with choices regarding the personal information you provide to us. We have created mechanisms to provide you with the following control over your information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tracking Technologies and Advertising.</strong> You can set your browser to refuse all or some browser cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. If you disable or refuse cookies, please note that some parts of this site may then be inaccessible or not function properly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Promotional Offers from the Company.</strong> If you do not wish to have your email address/contact information used by the Company to promote our own products or services, you can opt-out by checking the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data or at any other time by sending us an email stating your request to <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a> . If we have sent you a promotional email, you may send us a return email asking to be omitted from future email distributions or selecting the unsubscribe link at the bottom of the email.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Targeted Advertising.</strong> If you do not want us to use information that we collect or that you provide to us to deliver advertisements according to our advertisers\' target-audience preferences, you can opt-out by <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control third parties\' collection or use of your information to serve interest-based advertising. However these third parties may provide you with ways to choose not to have your information collected or used in this way. You can opt out of receiving targeted ads from members of the Network Advertising Initiative (\"<strong>NAI</strong>\") on the NAI\'s website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>[Accessing and Correcting Your Information]</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can review and change your personal information by sending us an email at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;to request access to, correct, or delete any personal information that you have provided to us. We may not be able to delete your personal information except by also deleting your user account. We may not accommodate a request to change information if we believe the change would violate any law or legal requirement or cause the information to be incorrect.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you delete your User Contributions from the Website, copies of your User Contributions may remain viewable in cached and archived pages, or might have been copied or stored by other Website users. [Proper access and use of information provided on the Website, including User Contributions, is governed by our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>terms of use https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your State Privacy Rights</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>State consumer privacy laws may provide their residents with additional rights regarding our use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>California, Colorado, Connecticut, Delaware, Florida, Indiana, Iowa, Montana, Oregon, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, and Virginia provide (now or in the future) their state residents with rights to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Confirm whether we process their personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Access and delete certain personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Correct inaccuracies in their personal information, taking into account the information\'s nature processing purpose (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data portability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Opt-out of personal data processing for:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>targeted advertising (excluding Iowa);</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>sales; or </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>profiling in furtherance of decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Either limit (opt-out of) or require consent to process sensitive personal data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The exact scope of these rights may vary by state. To exercise any of these rights, or to appeal a decision regarding a consumer rights request, email us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nevada provides its residents with a limited right to opt-out of certain personal information sales. However, please know we do not currently sell data triggering that statute\'s opt-out requirements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Changes to Our Privacy Policy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is our policy to post any changes we make to our privacy policy on this page. If we make material changes to how we treat our users\' personal information, we will notify you on the Website home page. The date the privacy policy was last revised is identified at the top of the page. You are responsible for ensuring we have an up-to-date active and deliverable email address for you, and for periodically visiting our Website and this privacy policy to check for any changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Contact Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To ask questions or comment about this privacy policy and our privacy practices, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To register a complaint or concern, please emails us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;or mail us at</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.<br>5151 Woodman Ave #44<br>Sherman Oaks, California, 91423</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-08 13:00:08', '2025-04-08 13:00:08', '', 3, 'http://pet.test/?p=30', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(31, 1, '2025-04-08 13:01:39', '2025-04-08 13:01:39', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Introduction</span></strong><br>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.(<strong>\"Company\"</strong> or<strong> \"We\"</strong>) respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy describes the types of information we may collect from you or that you may provide when you visit the website personalempowermentteams.me (our \"<strong>Website</strong>\") and our practices for collecting, using, maintaining, protecting, and disclosing that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy applies to information we collect:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On this Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In email, and other electronic messages between you and this <strong>Website or Company.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It does not apply to information collected by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Us offline or through any other means, including on any other website operated by Company or any third party.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please read this policy carefully to understand our policies and practices regarding your information and how we will treat it. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, your choice is not to use our Website. By accessing or using this Website, you agree to this privacy policy. This policy may change from time to time. Your continued use of this Website after we make changes is deemed to be acceptance of those changes, so please check the policy periodically for updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Children Under the Age of 18</span></strong><br>Our Website is not intended for children under 18 years of age. No one under age 18 may provide any information to Company or on the Website. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If you are under 18, do not use or provide any information on this Website or provide any information about yourself to us, including your name, address, telephone number, email address, or any screen name or user name you may use. If we learn we have collected or received personal information from a child under 18 without verification of parental consent, we will delete that information. If you believe we might have any information from or about a child under 18, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Information We Collect About You and How We Collect It</span></strong><br>We collect several types of information from and about users of our Website, including information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>By which you may be personally identified, such as name, username, postal address, email address, telephone number (\"<strong>personal information</strong>”); and/or</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>About your internet connection, the equipment you use to access our Website, and usage details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We collect this information:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Directly from you when you provide it to us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automatically as you navigate through the site. Information collected automatically may include usage details, IP addresses, and information collected through cookies, web beacons, and other tracking technologies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>Information You Provide to Us</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect on or through our Website may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information that you provide by filling in forms on our Website. This includes information provided at the time of submitting a contact form, subscribing to our service, posting material, or requesting further services. We may also ask you for information to assist you in the use and navigation of the website and/or when you report a problem with our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Records and copies of your correspondence (including email addresses), if you contact us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your responses to surveys that we might ask you to complete for research purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You also may provide information to be published or displayed (hereinafter, \"<strong>posted</strong>\") on public areas of the Website, or transmitted to other users of the Website or third parties (collectively, \"<strong>User Contributions</strong>\"). Your User Contributions are posted on and transmitted to others at your own risk. Please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable. Additionally, we cannot control the actions of other users of the Website with whom you may choose to share your User Contributions. Therefore, we cannot and do not guarantee that your User Contributions will not be viewed by unauthorized persons.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Information We Collect Through Automatic Data Collection Technologies</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you navigate through and interact with our Website, we may use automatic data collection technologies to collect certain information about your equipment, browsing actions, and patterns, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Details of your visits to our Website, including traffic data, location data, logs, and other communication data and the resources that you access and use on the Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information about your computer and internet connection, including your IP address, operating system, and browser type.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect automatically does not include personal information, but we may maintain it or associate it with personal information we collect in other ways or receive from third parties. It helps us to improve our Website and to deliver a better and more personalized service, including by enabling us to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Estimate our audience size and usage patterns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Store information about your preferences, allowing us to customize our Website according to your individual interests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Speed up your searches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recognize you when you return to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The technologies we use for this automatic data collection may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cookies (or browser cookies).</strong> A cookie is a small file placed on the hard drive of your computer. You may refuse to accept browser cookies by activating the appropriate setting on your browser. However, if you select this setting you may be unable to access certain parts of our Website. Unless you have adjusted your browser setting so that it will refuse cookies, our system will issue cookies when you direct your browser to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Web Beacons. </strong>Pages of our Website and our emails may contain small electronic files known as web beacons (also referred to as clear gifs, pixel tags, and single-pixel gifs) that permit the Company, for example, to count users who have visited those pages or opened an email and for other related website statistics (for example, recording the popularity of certain website content and verifying system and server integrity).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not collect personal information automatically, but we may tie non-personal information collected automatically to personal information about you that we collect from other sources or that you provide to us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Third-Party Use of Cookies [and Other Tracking Technologies</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some content or applications, including advertisements, on the Website are served by third-parties, including advertisers, ad networks and servers, content providers, and application providers. These third parties may use cookies alone or in conjunction with web beacons or other tracking technologies to collect information about you when you use our website. The information they collect may be associated with your personal information or they may collect information, including personal information, about your online activities over time and across different websites and other online services. They may use this information to provide you with interest-based (behavioral) advertising or other targeted content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control these third parties\' tracking technologies or how they may be used. If you have any questions about an advertisement or other targeted content, you should contact the responsible provider directly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How We Use Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use information that we collect about you or that you provide to us, including any personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To present our Website and its contents to you.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To provide you with information, products, or services that you request from us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill any other purpose for which you provide it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To carry out our obligations and enforce our rights arising from any contracts entered into between you and us, including for billing and collection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To notify you about changes to our Website or any products or services we offer or provide though it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In any other way we may describe when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose with your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also use your information to contact you about our own goods and services that may be of interest to you. If you do not want us to use your information in this way, please check the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Disclosure of Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose aggregated information about our users and information that does not identify any individual without restriction.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose personal information that we collect or you provide as described in this privacy policy:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To contractors, service providers, and other third parties we use to support our business.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To a buyer or other successor in the event of a merger, divestiture, restructuring, reorganization, dissolution, or other sale or transfer of some or all of Company\'s assets, whether as a going concern or as part of bankruptcy, liquidation, or similar proceeding, in which personal information held by Company about our Website users is among the assets transferred.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill the purpose for which you provide it. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose disclosed by us when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also disclose your personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To comply with any court order, law, or legal process, including to respond to any government or regulatory request.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To enforce or apply our <a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">terms of use</a> (<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>) and other agreements, including for billing and collection purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If we believe disclosure is necessary or appropriate to protect the rights, property, or safety of the Company, our customers, or others.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Choices About How We Use and Disclose Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We strive to provide you with choices regarding the personal information you provide to us. We have created mechanisms to provide you with the following control over your information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tracking Technologies and Advertising.</strong> You can set your browser to refuse all or some browser cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. If you disable or refuse cookies, please note that some parts of this site may then be inaccessible or not function properly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Promotional Offers from the Company.</strong> If you do not wish to have your email address/contact information used by the Company to promote our own products or services, you can opt-out by checking the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data or at any other time by sending us an email stating your request to <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a> . If we have sent you a promotional email, you may send us a return email asking to be omitted from future email distributions or selecting the unsubscribe link at the bottom of the email.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Targeted Advertising.</strong> If you do not want us to use information that we collect or that you provide to us to deliver advertisements according to our advertisers\' target-audience preferences, you can opt-out by <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control third parties\' collection or use of your information to serve interest-based advertising. However these third parties may provide you with ways to choose not to have your information collected or used in this way. You can opt out of receiving targeted ads from members of the Network Advertising Initiative (\"<strong>NAI</strong>\") on the NAI\'s website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>[Accessing and Correcting Your Information]</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can review and change your personal information by sending us an email at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;to request access to, correct, or delete any personal information that you have provided to us. We may not be able to delete your personal information except by also deleting your user account. We may not accommodate a request to change information if we believe the change would violate any law or legal requirement or cause the information to be incorrect.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you delete your User Contributions from the Website, copies of your User Contributions may remain viewable in cached and archived pages, or might have been copied or stored by other Website users. [Proper access and use of information provided on the Website, including User Contributions, is governed by our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>terms of use https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your State Privacy Rights</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>State consumer privacy laws may provide their residents with additional rights regarding our use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>California, Colorado, Connecticut, Delaware, Florida, Indiana, Iowa, Montana, Oregon, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, and Virginia provide (now or in the future) their state residents with rights to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Confirm whether we process their personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Access and delete certain personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Correct inaccuracies in their personal information, taking into account the information\'s nature processing purpose (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data portability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Opt-out of personal data processing for:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>targeted advertising (excluding Iowa);</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>sales; or </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>profiling in furtherance of decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Either limit (opt-out of) or require consent to process sensitive personal data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The exact scope of these rights may vary by state. To exercise any of these rights, or to appeal a decision regarding a consumer rights request, email us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nevada provides its residents with a limited right to opt-out of certain personal information sales. However, please know we do not currently sell data triggering that statute\'s opt-out requirements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Changes to Our Privacy Policy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is our policy to post any changes we make to our privacy policy on this page. If we make material changes to how we treat our users\' personal information, we will notify you on the Website home page. The date the privacy policy was last revised is identified at the top of the page. You are responsible for ensuring we have an up-to-date active and deliverable email address for you, and for periodically visiting our Website and this privacy policy to check for any changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Contact Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To ask questions or comment about this privacy policy and our privacy practices, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To register a complaint or concern, please emails us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;or mail us at</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.<br>5151 Woodman Ave #44<br>Sherman Oaks, California, 91423</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-04-08 13:01:39', '2025-04-08 13:01:39', '', 3, 'http://pet.test/?p=31', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `pet_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(32, 1, '2025-04-08 13:01:45', '2025-04-08 13:01:45', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Introduction</span></strong><br>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.(<strong>\"Company\"</strong> or<strong> \"We\"</strong>) respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy describes the types of information we may collect from you or that you may provide when you visit the website personalempowermentteams.me (our \"<strong>Website</strong>\") and our practices for collecting, using, maintaining, protecting, and disclosing that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy applies to information we collect:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On this Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In email, and other electronic messages between you and this <strong>Website or Company.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It does not apply to information collected by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Us offline or through any other means, including on any other website operated by Company or any third party.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please read this policy carefully to understand our policies and practices regarding your information and how we will treat it. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, your choice is not to use our Website. By accessing or using this Website, you agree to this privacy policy. This policy may change from time to time. Your continued use of this Website after we make changes is deemed to be acceptance of those changes, so please check the policy periodically for updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Children Under the Age of 18</span></strong><br>Our Website is not intended for children under 18 years of age. No one under age 18 may provide any information to Company or on the Website. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If you are under 18, do not use or provide any information on this Website or provide any information about yourself to us, including your name, address, telephone number, email address, or any screen name or user name you may use. If we learn we have collected or received personal information from a child under 18 without verification of parental consent, we will delete that information. If you believe we might have any information from or about a child under 18, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Information We Collect About You and How We Collect It</span></strong><br>We collect several types of information from and about users of our Website, including information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>By which you may be personally identified, such as name, username, postal address, email address, telephone number (\"<strong>personal information</strong>”); and/or</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>About your internet connection, the equipment you use to access our Website, and usage details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We collect this information:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Directly from you when you provide it to us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automatically as you navigate through the site. Information collected automatically may include usage details, IP addresses, and information collected through cookies, web beacons, and other tracking technologies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>Information You Provide to Us</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect on or through our Website may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information that you provide by filling in forms on our Website. This includes information provided at the time of submitting a contact form, subscribing to our service, posting material, or requesting further services. We may also ask you for information to assist you in the use and navigation of the website and/or when you report a problem with our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Records and copies of your correspondence (including email addresses), if you contact us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your responses to surveys that we might ask you to complete for research purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You also may provide information to be published or displayed (hereinafter, \"<strong>posted</strong>\") on public areas of the Website, or transmitted to other users of the Website or third parties (collectively, \"<strong>User Contributions</strong>\"). Your User Contributions are posted on and transmitted to others at your own risk. Please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable. Additionally, we cannot control the actions of other users of the Website with whom you may choose to share your User Contributions. Therefore, we cannot and do not guarantee that your User Contributions will not be viewed by unauthorized persons.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Information We Collect Through Automatic Data Collection Technologies</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you navigate through and interact with our Website, we may use automatic data collection technologies to collect certain information about your equipment, browsing actions, and patterns, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Details of your visits to our Website, including traffic data, location data, logs, and other communication data and the resources that you access and use on the Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information about your computer and internet connection, including your IP address, operating system, and browser type.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The information we collect automatically does not include personal information, but we may maintain it or associate it with personal information we collect in other ways or receive from third parties. It helps us to improve our Website and to deliver a better and more personalized service, including by enabling us to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Estimate our audience size and usage patterns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Store information about your preferences, allowing us to customize our Website according to your individual interests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Speed up your searches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recognize you when you return to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The technologies we use for this automatic data collection may include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cookies (or browser cookies).</strong> A cookie is a small file placed on the hard drive of your computer. You may refuse to accept browser cookies by activating the appropriate setting on your browser. However, if you select this setting you may be unable to access certain parts of our Website. Unless you have adjusted your browser setting so that it will refuse cookies, our system will issue cookies when you direct your browser to our Website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Web Beacons. </strong>Pages of our Website and our emails may contain small electronic files known as web beacons (also referred to as clear gifs, pixel tags, and single-pixel gifs) that permit the Company, for example, to count users who have visited those pages or opened an email and for other related website statistics (for example, recording the popularity of certain website content and verifying system and server integrity).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not collect personal information automatically, but we may tie non-personal information collected automatically to personal information about you that we collect from other sources or that you provide to us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Third-Party Use of Cookies [and Other Tracking Technologies</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some content or applications, including advertisements, on the Website are served by third-parties, including advertisers, ad networks and servers, content providers, and application providers. These third parties may use cookies alone or in conjunction with web beacons or other tracking technologies to collect information about you when you use our website. The information they collect may be associated with your personal information or they may collect information, including personal information, about your online activities over time and across different websites and other online services. They may use this information to provide you with interest-based (behavioral) advertising or other targeted content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control these third parties\' tracking technologies or how they may be used. If you have any questions about an advertisement or other targeted content, you should contact the responsible provider directly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How We Use Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use information that we collect about you or that you provide to us, including any personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To present our Website and its contents to you.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To provide you with information, products, or services that you request from us.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill any other purpose for which you provide it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To carry out our obligations and enforce our rights arising from any contracts entered into between you and us, including for billing and collection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To notify you about changes to our Website or any products or services we offer or provide though it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In any other way we may describe when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose with your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also use your information to contact you about our own goods and services that may be of interest to you. If you do not want us to use your information in this way, please check the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Disclosure of Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose aggregated information about our users and information that does not identify any individual without restriction.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may disclose personal information that we collect or you provide as described in this privacy policy:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To contractors, service providers, and other third parties we use to support our business.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To a buyer or other successor in the event of a merger, divestiture, restructuring, reorganization, dissolution, or other sale or transfer of some or all of Company\'s assets, whether as a going concern or as part of bankruptcy, liquidation, or similar proceeding, in which personal information held by Company about our Website users is among the assets transferred.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fulfill the purpose for which you provide it. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For any other purpose disclosed by us when you provide the information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With your consent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may also disclose your personal information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To comply with any court order, law, or legal process, including to respond to any government or regulatory request.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To enforce or apply our <a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">terms of use</a> (<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>) and other agreements, including for billing and collection purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If we believe disclosure is necessary or appropriate to protect the rights, property, or safety of the Company, our customers, or others.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Choices About How We Use and Disclose Your Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We strive to provide you with choices regarding the personal information you provide to us. We have created mechanisms to provide you with the following control over your information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tracking Technologies and Advertising.</strong> You can set your browser to refuse all or some browser cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. If you disable or refuse cookies, please note that some parts of this site may then be inaccessible or not function properly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Promotional Offers from the Company.</strong> If you do not wish to have your email address/contact information used by the Company to promote our own products or services, you can opt-out by checking the relevant box located on the form on which we collect your data or at any other time by sending us an email stating your request to <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a> . If we have sent you a promotional email, you may send us a return email asking to be omitted from future email distributions or selecting the unsubscribe link at the bottom of the email.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Targeted Advertising.</strong> If you do not want us to use information that we collect or that you provide to us to deliver advertisements according to our advertisers\' target-audience preferences, you can opt-out by <a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not control third parties\' collection or use of your information to serve interest-based advertising. However these third parties may provide you with ways to choose not to have your information collected or used in this way. You can opt out of receiving targeted ads from members of the Network Advertising Initiative (\"<strong>NAI</strong>\") on the NAI\'s website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>[Accessing and Correcting Your Information]</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can review and change your personal information by sending us an email at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;to request access to, correct, or delete any personal information that you have provided to us. We may not be able to delete your personal information except by also deleting your user account. We may not accommodate a request to change information if we believe the change would violate any law or legal requirement or cause the information to be incorrect.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you delete your User Contributions from the Website, copies of your User Contributions may remain viewable in cached and archived pages, or might have been copied or stored by other Website users. [Proper access and use of information provided on the Website, including User Contributions, is governed by our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>terms of use https://personalempowermentteams.me/terms-of-use</u></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your State Privacy Rights</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>State consumer privacy laws may provide their residents with additional rights regarding our use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>California, Colorado, Connecticut, Delaware, Florida, Indiana, Iowa, Montana, Oregon, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, and Virginia provide (now or in the future) their state residents with rights to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Confirm whether we process their personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Access and delete certain personal information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Correct inaccuracies in their personal information, taking into account the information\'s nature processing purpose (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data portability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Opt-out of personal data processing for:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>targeted advertising (excluding Iowa);</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>sales; or </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>profiling in furtherance of decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects (excluding Iowa and Utah).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Either limit (opt-out of) or require consent to process sensitive personal data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The exact scope of these rights may vary by state. To exercise any of these rights, or to appeal a decision regarding a consumer rights request, email us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nevada provides its residents with a limited right to opt-out of certain personal information sales. However, please know we do not currently sell data triggering that statute\'s opt-out requirements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Changes to Our Privacy Policy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is our policy to post any changes we make to our privacy policy on this page. If we make material changes to how we treat our users\' personal information, we will notify you on the Website home page. The date the privacy policy was last revised is identified at the top of the page. You are responsible for ensuring we have an up-to-date active and deliverable email address for you, and for periodically visiting our Website and this privacy policy to check for any changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Contact Information</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To ask questions or comment about this privacy policy and our privacy practices, contact us at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To register a complaint or concern, please emails us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u>Joseph@PersonalEmpowermentTeams.me</u></a>&nbsp;or mail us at</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.<br>5151 Woodman Ave #44<br>Sherman Oaks, California, 91423</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-08 13:01:45', '2025-04-08 13:01:45', '', 3, 'http://pet.test/?p=32', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(33, 1, '2025-04-08 13:02:38', '2025-04-08 13:02:38', '<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Non-Medical Advice Disclaimer:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use this anywhere you discuss or mention mental, physical, or emotional well-being. Examples include mention of diabetes, mental health, and emotional items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>The content and information provided is not medical advice, nor should it be perceived as medical advice, mental health advice, nor be used to diagnose or treat any ailment. Always seek the advice of your physician, therapist, counselor, mental health practitioner, or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Financial Outcome Disclaimer:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use this anywhere you mention your past business successes, mention or list a dollar amount you’ve earned, and anytime you mention business or financial steps, actions, stories, or information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>The content provided is for informational purposes only. It is not intended, nor should it be construed as business, financial, or legal advice. While personal financial and business experiences or opinions may be shared or expressed, we do not guarantee or promise any specific financial outcomes. Viewers should not act or refrain from acting on the basis of any information contained in this video without seeking appropriate professional advice. You are solely responsible for your reliance on and any actions or inactions taken due to the information contained in the video, and no such reliance is intended or implied. By using this information, you waive any claims against PersonalEmpowermentTeams for any financial outcomes or decisions resulting from your use of the content provided.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Non-Religious Advice Disclaimer:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use this any time you mention religion, faith, your background as a pastor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>The content and information provided are not intended as religious or spiritual guidance. No pastor-parishioner relationship is created or implied between you and Personalempowermentteams or is representatives. This content is secular in nature and does not promote any specific religious beliefs or practices. Any reference to past religious affiliations or experiences is for context only, and no endorsement of any particular faith or denomination is implied.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Informational and Educational Purposes Only + 5. No Guarantees + 6. Personal Responsibility.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recommend using on&nbsp;<em>all content</em>&nbsp;wherever practicable to do so.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>All content, including but not limited to videos, articles, blog posts, and meeting sessions, is provided for informational and educational purposes only. We make no representations, or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, suitability, or availability of the information contained in this content. No guarantees or representations are made regarding specific outcomes or results from using the information or services provided. You are solely responsible for your own actions, reliance on the information provided, and any consequences thereof. The creators will not be liable for any errors or omissions in this information nor for any losses, injuries, or damages arising from its display or use.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Disclaimers', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'disclaimers', '', '', '2025-04-08 13:02:38', '2025-04-08 13:02:38', '', 0, 'http://pet.test/?page_id=33', 0, 'page', '', 0),
