aragraph {\"placeholder\":\"type content or press / to add block..\"} -->\n<p>The Q&amp;A Intro is to help you determine whether you want to participate in an Empowerment Team or not. Goals are challenging, so we want you to confirm that you are committing to your dreams and that you are 100% All In. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:esab/accordion-child --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:esab/accordion -->', 'Q&amp;A Intro: See Why an Empowerment Team Will Change Your Life', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-08 13:58:16', '2025-04-08 13:58:16', '', 18, 'http://pet.test/?p=49', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
