p;A Intros about? </strong></p></div><div class=\"esab__icon\"><div class=\"esab__collapse\"> <svg version=\"1.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"m3.5 20.5c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17 4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0 4.6 4.7 4.6 12.3 0 17-4.7 4.6-12.3 4.6-17 0zm0.9-0.9c4.2 4.2 11 4.2 15.2 0 4.2-4.2 4.2-11 0-15.2-4.2-4.3-11-4.3-15.2 0-4.3 4.2-4.3 11 0 15.2z\"></path><path d=\"m11.4 15.9v-3.3h-3.3c-0.3 0-0.6-0.3-0.6-0.6 0-0.4 0.3-0.6 0.6-0.6h3.3v-3.3c0-0.3 0.3-0.6 0.6-0.6 0.3 0 0.6 0.3 0.6 0.6v3.3h3.3c0.3 0 0.6 0.2 0.6 0.6q0 0.2-0.2 0.4-0.2 0.2-0.4 0.2h-3.3v3.3q0 0.2-0.2 0.4-0.2 0.2-0.4 0.2c-0.4 0-0.6-0.3-0.6-0.6z\"></path></svg> </div><div class=\"esab__expand\"> <svg version=\"1.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"m12 24c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12 0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12 6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12 0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12zm10.6-12c0-5.9-4.7-10.6-10.6-10.6-5.9 0-10.6 4.7-10.6 10.6 0 5.9 4.7 10.6 10.6 10.6 5.9 0 10.6-4.7 10.6-10.6z\"></path><path d=\"m5.6 11.3h12.8v1.4h-12.8z\"></path></svg> </div></div></div><div class=\"esab__body\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"type content or press / to add block..\"} -->\n<p>The Q&amp;A Intro is to help you determine whether you want to participate in an Empowerment Team or not. Goals are challenging, so we want you to confirm that you are committing to your dreams and that you are 100% All In.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:esab/accordion-child -->\n\n<!-- wp:esab/accordion-child {\"uniqueId\":\"esab-7ckgs02u\",\"blockStyle\":\" .esab-7ckgs02u.wp-block-esab-accordion-child .esab__badge{border-style: solid;} \",\"heading\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAre there any costs to participate?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\",\"headingTag\":\"p\",\"collapsedIcon\":\"esab__circle_plus\",\"expandedIcon\":\"esab__circle_minus\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-esab-accordion-child\"><div class=\"esab__head\" role=\"button\" aria-expa