hat will I gain from Empowerment Teams?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item\"><details><summary class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__title\"><strong><strong><strong><strong>What will I gain from Empowerment Teams?</strong></strong></strong></strong></summary><div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Add content…\"} -->\n<p>We\'ll support you in becoming who and what you always wanted to be.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></details></div>\n<!-- /wp:coblocks/accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:coblocks/accordion -->', 'FAQs', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 15:40:10', '2025-04-21 15:40:10', '', 18, 'http://pet.test/?p=237', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
