(384, 1, '2025-07-13 08:50:46', '2025-07-13 08:50:46', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Addiction is more than just a bad habit—it’s a complex condition that affects the brain and behavior. Whether it\'s drugs, alcohol, gambling, or even technology, addiction creates a powerful craving that can take over a person\'s life. It often starts subtly but grows silently, causing emotional, physical, and social harm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recovery is possible, but it takes courage, support, and the right treatment. It\'s important to replace judgment with empathy and to support those fighting addiction with compassion and understanding. Remember, healing begins when we stop shaming and start helping.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Addiction: A Silent Struggle', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'shahjahan-siraj', '', '', '2025-07-18 15:19:50', '2025-07-18 15:19:50', '', 0, 'http://pet.test/?post_type=course&#038;p=384', 0, 'course', '', 0),
