iting Passionate Collaborators:<br>Especially in Outreach, <strong>Marketing, </strong>and Tech Support.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong>👇</strong>What’s in it for you<strong>👇</strong></strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>✅ Lifetime Profit-Sharing, and Revenue Streams<br>✅ Powerful Tools, AI, Marketing, Funnels, and More \"For Your Vision\"<br>✅ Founding Roles with Seniority, Perks, and Visibility<br>✅ Talk Show Interviews &amp; Promotions<br>✅ Leadership, Growth, Employment, Advancement<br>✅ Your Own White-Labeled Portal, Link, and Revenue Streams<br>✅ Change Lives — including Your Own<br>✅ Reconnect to your Heart and Make a Difference While You Grow your Destiny<strong><br></strong>✅ You weren’t born for the 9–5. You were born to <strong>lead</strong>, <strong>serve</strong>, and <strong>prosper.</strong><br>✅ You also get a customized invitation link to market and fund yourself and your vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"customFontSize\":27} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:27px\"><strong><strong>💥</strong></strong>OUR SOCIAL PLATFORM LOOKS SIMILAR TO FACEBOOK, LINKEDIN, INSTA, ETC...<br>PLUS, 24/7 INCLUDES ALL THE TOOLS &amp; PERKS LISTED BELOW</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"customFontSize\":21} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:21px\"><strong>🧠 AI </strong>(BASIC &amp; SPECIALIZED)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training &amp; Certification</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI Life &amp; Marketing Tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instant Prompt Support by Niche</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Script to Video, Audio to Video, and More</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Branding, Ad Copy, SEO, CRM Workflows</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specialized AI for Legal, Health, Fitness, Business, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🚀 MARKETING, REVENUE STREAMS &amp; PROFIT-SHARING</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training &amp; Certification</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Funnels, Calendars, CRM, Landing Pages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>White Label Branding</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Online Stores &amp; Payment Systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Press Releases, Logos, Ads, and Promotions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Legal Business Entities, DBAs, </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Complete Marketing Funnels</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🤝 TEAMWORK &amp; COLABORATION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Full Curriculum Training &amp; Certifications</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Zoom, Google Meet, Calendar Booking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Docs, Sheets, Project Planning</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Team building</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Talk Show Interviews</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>💬 REPUTATION MANAGEMENT</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google &amp; Yelp Review Tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Public Branding &amp; Profile Visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>📱 CONCURRENT SOCIAL - AUTOPOSTING</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Schedule posts across YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, and more — all at once</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"customFontSize\":25} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:25px\">👉 <strong>Ready to Be Part of History?</strong><br>✅Early Birds Catch the Big Worms. <br>✅Bring it! Bring your voice, your ideas, and your leadership.<br>✅Sign up now before the masses take your place.<strong><br></strong>✅Be the Eyes, Ears, and Heart of your Future.<br>✅Squash bugs, give feedback, &amp; Create Abundance in Your Life &amp; Vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Welcome', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '279-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-01 13:12:31', '2025-08-01 13:12:31', '', 279, 'http://pet.test/?p=422', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(425, 1, '2025-08-26 07:15:37', '2025-08-26 07:15:37', '<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/-aZKm7MWqlg\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/-aZKm7MWqlg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Business Grants for Startups, Founders, Creators, Coaches, and Visionaries</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Join our Personal Empowerment Teams and Nonprofit Platform packed with powerful Funding Tools, Angel Investors, and Crowdfunding for your Vision — all In One Place. Without Loans!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:coblocks/accordion -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion\"><!-- wp:coblocks/accordion-item {\"title\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e24/7 is powered by Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc., and has redefined how Leaders connect with Millions of Like-Minded people to Grow Their Vision.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item\"><details><summary class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__title\"><strong>24/7 is powered by Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc., and has redefined how Leaders connect with Millions of Like-Minded people to Grow Their Vision.</strong></summary><div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Add content…\",\"customFontSize\":25} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:25px\"><strong>Two Synergies That Turn Visionaries into Champions &amp; Millionaires</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Add content…\"} -->\n<p>1️⃣ <strong>Personal Empowerment Teams</strong> – Surround yourself with Coaches, Teams, and Trainers who bring the support, growth, and accountability you need to Win Big. We make Champions, not spectators! Don’t go it alone!<br>2️⃣<strong> Nonprofit Social Platform</strong> – Packed with Powerful, easy-to-use Revenue Tools to fund and scale your Life and Vision</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></details></div>\n<!-- /wp:coblocks/accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:coblocks/accordion-item {\"title\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eVisit https://www.youtube.com/@247Empowerment. Our Personal Empowerment Teams specialize in Relationships, Narcissism, Health, Habits, Money, Spirituality, Nonprofit Marketing Teams, and Affordable Housing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item\"><details><summary class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__title\"><strong><strong>Visit https://www.youtube.com/@247Empowerment. Our Personal Empowerment Teams specialize in Relationships, Narcissism, Health, Habits, Money, Spirituality, Nonprofit Marketing Teams, and Affordable Housing</strong></strong></summary><div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__content\"><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personal Empowerment Teams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Careers, Jobs, Advancement</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lifetime Profit-Sharing and Revenue Streams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powerful Tools, AI, Marketing, Funnels, and More \"For Your Vision\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Founding Roles with Seniority, Perks, and Visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Talk Show Interviews &amp; Promotions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leadership, Growth, Change Lives — including Your Own</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your Own White-Labeled Portal, Link, and Revenue Streams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reconnect and Make a Difference While You Grow Your Destiny</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You weren’t born for the 9–5. You were born to <strong>Lead</strong>, <strong>Serve</strong>, and <strong>Prosper.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Claim your custom invitation link to fund and market yourself and your vision.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div></details></div>\n<!-- /wp:coblocks/accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:coblocks/accordion-item {\"title\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eSurround yourself with Millions of Like-minded \\u0022Believers in your Mission\\u0022, and Raise Funds with built-in Funding Tools. No Credit Checks, No Debt\\u003c/strong\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item\"><details><summary class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__title\"><strong>Surround yourself with Millions of Like-minded \"Believers in your Mission\", and Raise Funds with built-in Funding Tools. No Credit Checks, No Debt</strong></summary><div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Add content…\"} -->\n<p><strong>We’re Hiring!</strong> Passionate Collaborators, <strong>Especially in Outreach, <strong>Sales, and Marketing</strong>. </strong><br>If interested, complete our form and book an appointment here: <a href=\"https://welcome.247empowerment.me/\">https://welcome.247empowerment.me</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Why Join Us? Our Market is Huge, and Growing</strong>:</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Personal Development:&nbsp;</strong><br>The global personal development market for 2025 is US $58 Billion. It’s projected to surpass USD $108 Billion by 2034.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Community Engagement Platforms:&nbsp;</strong><br>In 2025, the community engagement platforms market is estimated at USD $ 4.3 Billion, with projections to soar to USD $23 Billion by 2035</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Teams make Champions and Millionaires! </strong>As a key member of the 24/7 Empowerment movement, you’ll introduce people to a path of deeper self-awareness, personal responsibility, and community accountability. Your mission? To enroll motivated individuals into our life-changing Empowerment Teams—and help them step into the next chapter of their evolution.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Connect with individuals seeking personal growth and invite them into the Empowerment Team experience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Generate leads through cold outreach, referrals, and aligned communities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Engage in meaningful conversations that inspire action and enrollment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Support prospects in understanding how Empowerment Teams work and why they matter.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Represent the mission and values of 24/7 with clarity, integrity, and enthusiasm.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Maintain consistent follow-up with leads and track your outreach in an organized system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Collaborate with other team members to refine messaging and improve enrollment flow.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A strong communicator who thrives in one-on-one conversations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Deep belief in personal development, healing, and community transformation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Self-motivated, mission-driven, and committed to making a difference.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prior sales or outreach experience is a plus—but heart and drive matter more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comfortable with cold outreach and building connections from scratch.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Able to work independently and take ownership of your pipeline and results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div></details></div>\n<!-- /wp:coblocks/accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:coblocks/accordion-item {\"title\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eUnlike traditional platforms, we’re a Nonprofit with a Mission to empower and Fund Visionaries like you without Loans\\u003c/strong\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item\"><details><summary class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__title\"><strong>Unlike traditional platforms, we’re a Nonprofit with a Mission to empower and Fund Visionaries like you without Loans</strong></summary><div class=\"wp-block-coblocks-accordion-item__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>TEAMWORK &amp; COLABORATION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Full Curriculum Training &amp; Certifications</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Zoom, Google Meet, Calendar Booking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Docs, Sheets, Project Planning</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Team building</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Talk Show Interviews</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>MARKETING, REVENUE STREAMS &amp; PROFIT-SHARING</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training &amp; Certification</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Funnels, Calendars, CRM, Landing Pages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>White Label Branding</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Online Stores &amp; Payment Systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Press Releases, Logos, Ads, and Promotions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Legal Business Entities, DBAs, </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Complete Marketing Funnels</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Add content…\"} -->\n<p><strong>AI </strong>(BASIC &amp; SPECIALIZED)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training &amp; Certification</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI Life &amp; Marketing Tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instant Prompt Support by Niche</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Script to Video, Audio to Video, and More</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Branding, Ad Copy, SEO, CRM Workflows</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specialized AI for Legal, Health, Fitness, Business, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More..</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>REPUTATION MANAGEMENT</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li