tor of Graphic Arts and Website Design:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Nelia Voshchynchuk</strong> leads the visual and digital design vision at<strong> Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.</strong>, where her deep sense of empathy, creativity, and precision fuels mission-driven design. As <strong>Director of Graphic Arts and Website Design</strong>, she crafts visually compelling and highly functional experiences that reflect the heart of empowerment and connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With over<strong> 10 years of diverse experience </strong>across international platforms, creative agencies, and independent projects, Nelia has contributed to platforms such as lbry.app and admitwell.com, and led design efforts for e-commerce and educational tech solutions. Her specialty lies in<strong> building intuitive, user-centered designs</strong> and scalable systems from the ground up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Nelia’s work</strong> is not only guided by aesthetic excellence but by a <strong>deep personal mission</strong>. As the proud <strong>wife of a Ukrainian soldier</strong> and <strong>mother to a beloved daughter</strong>, her passion for meaningful design is grounded in<strong> love</strong>, <strong>resilience,</strong> and a <strong>desire to uplift </strong>others through every digital touchpoint.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>At Personal Empowerment Teams, Inc.</strong>, Nelia transforms vision into vibrant reality—creating designs that <strong>connect</strong>, <strong>inspire</strong>, and <strong>empower</strong> communities around the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '476-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-02 18:42:59', '2025-10-02 18:42:59', '', 476, 'http://pet.test/?p=477', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
